 "statement": "Let $u:T'\\to T$ be finite surjective. Suppose $s'\\in(u^{-1}F)(T')$ is\nequipped with a descended section $s\\in F(T)$, meaning\n$u_T^\\sharp(s)=s'$. Then the same equality holds after restriction to a\nclosed fibre.",
